---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import childWord from '../assets/child-word.png';
---
<section class="about-section container section-rule" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"><p class="eyebrow">About YAER</p><div class="about-grid"><div><h2 id="about-title">Ideas inspired by everyday life.</h2><p class="section-copy">YAER is where curiosity meets problem solving. Our ideas often begin with something surprisingly simple:</p><p class="section-copy about-question"><em>“Why does this have to be so difficult?”</em></p><p class="section-copy">We explore better ways to solve everyday problems and turn the ideas worth pursuing into thoughtful, practical products.</p><p class="section-copy">Sometimes, the answer becomes a product.</p></div><div class="about-illustration"><Image src={childWord} widths={[320, 640, 960]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 80vw, 30vw" format="webp" alt="Pencil illustration of a curious child looking upward above the YAER wordmark." loading="lazy" /></div></div></section>
